  "description": "Three-headed kill-order boss. Whenever the Hydra loses a head, the survivors heal 60 and gain Frenzy. Kill both side heads in the SAME round to skip one surge. The armored Crown Head (600 HP) becomes Exposed and takes 2.5x damage only after both side heads fall. Cleave hits every head evenly; focused attacks finish one head. Every 4th round the Hydra drags someone under. Next: slain. Failure: 12-round limit.",
